// 银行柜面现金长短款复核与缴回系统 — 数据模型
// 金额一律以“分”为单位的整数存储，避免浮点误差。

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

enum Role {
  TELLER
  SUPERVISOR
  FINANCE
}

enum DayStatus {
  OPEN
  CLOSED
}

enum ClosingStatus {
  SUBMITTED // 已提交，待复核
  REJECTED  // 复核退回
  REVIEWED  // 复核通过，已生成处置单
  SETTLED   // 全部处置完成
}

enum ReviewDecision {
  APPROVE
  REJECT
}

enum AdjustmentType {
  CORRECTION // 盘点修正（机器/手工不一致后的确认、重复盘点更正）
  HANDOVER   // 跨班交接差异
  FOUND_CASH // 事后找到现金
}

enum DispositionKind {
  OVERAGE_CLAIM       // 长款：待认领
  SHORTAGE_PAYBACK    // 短款：缴回
  SHORTAGE_STATEMENT  // 短款：责任说明
}

enum DispositionStatus {
  PENDING
  CONFIRMED
  REVERSED
  CANCELLED // 被后续调整合并取消（保留审计痕迹）
}

enum ReceiptAction {
  CONFIRM
  REVERSAL
}

enum LedgerKind {
  CLOSING_DIFF // 复核确认的结柜差额（正=长款，负=短款）
  ADJUSTMENT   // 调整记录（修正/交接/找到现金）
  PAYBACK      // 短款缴回入账
  CLAIM_OUT    // 长款认领出账
  STATEMENT    // 短款责任说明挂账（应收柜员）
  REVERSAL     // 财务冲销
}

model User {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  username  String   @unique
  name      String
  role      Role
  closings  CashClosing[]
  reviews   Review[]
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model BusinessDay {
  id        String       @id @default(cuid())
  date      String       @unique // YYYY-MM-DD
  status    DayStatus    @default(OPEN)
  openedAt  DateTime     @default(now())
  closedAt  DateTime?
  closings  CashClosing[]
  ledger    LedgerEntry[]
}

model CashClosing {
  id            String        @id @default(cuid())
  businessDayId String
  businessDay   BusinessDay   @relation(fields: [businessDayId], references: [id])
  tellerId      String
  teller        User          @relation(fields: [tellerId], references: [id])
  shift         String // MORNING / EVENING —— 同一柜员同一营业日同一班次只允许一张结柜单
  status        ClosingStatus @default(SUBMITTED)
  expectedCents Int
  actualCents   Int
  diffCents     Int // actual - expected；正=长款，负=短款
  countConflict Boolean       @default(false) // 机器点钞与手工盘点不一致，需复核确认
  lines         DenomLine[]
  reviews       Review[]
  adjustments   Adjustment[]
  dispositions  Disposition[]
  ledgerEntries LedgerEntry[]
  createdAt     DateTime      @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime      @updatedAt

  @@unique([businessDayId, tellerId, shift])
}

model DenomLine {
  id          String      @id @default(cuid())
  closingId   String
  closing     CashClosing @relation(fields: [closingId], references: [id])
  denomCents  Int // 面额（分）
  expectedQty Int // 应有数量（账面）
  manualQty   Int // 手工盘点数量
  machineQty  Int? // 点钞机数量（可空）
  finalQty    Int // 确认数量：默认=手工，修正调整可改
}

model Review {
  id         String         @id @default(cuid())
  closingId  String // 一张结柜单可有多条复核记录（退回→修正→复复核）；并发由结柜单状态守卫保证只推进一次
  closing    CashClosing    @relation(fields: [closingId], references: [id])
  reviewerId String
  reviewer   User           @relation(fields: [reviewerId], references: [id])
  decision   ReviewDecision
  comment    String?
  createdAt  DateTime       @default(now())

  @@index([closingId])
}

model Adjustment {
  id                  String         @id @default(cuid())
  closingId           String
  closing             CashClosing    @relation(fields: [closingId], references: [id])
  type                AdjustmentType
  originBusinessDayId String // 差额归属营业日（跨日保留归属）
  createdBusinessDayId String // 实际录入的营业日
  note                String?
  deltaCents          Int // 对未解决差额的修正量（正=补回现金/核销长款，负=反向）
  linesJson           String? // 修正时的面额明细快照（原始记录，可追溯）
  createdById         String
  createdAt           DateTime       @default(now())
}

model Disposition {
  id          String            @id @default(cuid())
  closingId   String
  closing     CashClosing       @relation(fields: [closingId], references: [id])
  kind        DispositionKind
  amountCents Int
  status      DispositionStatus @default(PENDING)
  receipts    FinanceReceipt[]
  createdAt   DateTime          @default(now())
}

model FinanceReceipt {
  id            String         @id @default(cuid())
  receiptNo     String         @unique // 幂等键：重复财务回执不得重复处理/重复冲销
  dispositionId String
  disposition   Disposition    @relation(fields: [dispositionId], references: [id])
  action        ReceiptAction
  amountCents   Int
  createdAt     DateTime       @default(now())
}

model LedgerEntry {
  id             String      @id @default(cuid())
  businessDayId  String // 归属营业日：跨日调整记在原营业日
  businessDay    BusinessDay @relation(fields: [businessDayId], references: [id])
  closingId      String?
  closing        CashClosing? @relation(fields: [closingId], references: [id])
  dispositionId  String?
  adjustmentId   String?
  kind           LedgerKind
  amountCents    Int // 有符号金额
  idempotencyKey String      @unique // 并发/重试防重复入账
  createdAt      DateTime    @default(now())
}
